<chapter xml:id="chapter-hypothesis-testing" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Hypothesis Testing - Implementations</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      After doing all of the setup for hypothesis testing for the
      specific case of a difference in proportions, we want to apply
      the same ideas to a variety of different statistical situations.
      This chapter runs through those variations of hypotheses
      testing, introducing the new mathematics we need along the way. 
    </p>
  </introduction>

